<view class="game-container"><view class="game-header"><text class="game-title">贪吃蛇</text><view class="header-right"><text class="score">分数: {{a}}</text><button class="about-btn" bindtap="{{b}}">关于</button></view></view><view class="game-board" ref="gameBoard"><view class="grid-background"></view><view wx:for="{{c}}" wx:for-item="segment" wx:key="a" class="snake-segment" style="{{'left:' + segment.b + ';' + ('top:' + segment.c) + ';' + ('background:' + segment.d)}}"></view><view wx:if="{{d}}" class="food" style="{{'left:' + e + ';' + ('top:' + f)}}"></view><view wx:if="{{g}}" class="game-start"><text class="start-title">贪吃蛇</text><text class="start-subtitle">使用摇杆控制蛇的移动</text><text class="start-subtitle">吃到食物得分，撞到墙壁或自身游戏结束</text><button class="start-btn" bindtap="{{h}}">开始游戏</button></view><view wx:if="{{i}}" class="game-over"><text class="over-title">游戏结束</text><text class="over-score">最终分数: {{j}}</text><button class="restart-btn" bindtap="{{k}}">重新开始</button></view></view><view class="joystick-container"><view class="joystick-wrapper"><view class="joystick-base" ref="joystickBase"><view class="joystick-knob" ref="joystickKnob" style="{{'transform:' + l}}" bindtouchstart="{{m}}" bindtouchmove="{{n}}" bindtouchend="{{o}}" bindtouchcancel="{{p}}"></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{q}}" class="about-popup" bindtap="{{t}}"><view class="about-content" catchtap="{{s}}"><view class="decoration-top"><text class="decoration-icon">🐍</text></view><view class="title-container"><text class="about-title">🎮 关于贪吃蛇 🎮</text><text class="subtitle">经典重现，童年回忆</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="about-info"><view class="info-item"><text class="info-icon">👨‍💻</text><view class="info-text"><text class="info-label">✨ 作者</text><text class="info-value">Seaton</text></view></view><view class="info-item"><text class="info-icon">📦</text><view class="info-text"><text class="info-label">🏷️ 版本号</text><text class="info-value">v1.0.0</text></view></view><view class="info-item"><text class="info-icon">📅</text><view class="info-text"><text class="info-label">🗓️ 发布时间</text><text class="info-value">2026年2月</text></view></view><view class="info-item"><text class="info-icon">🎯</text><view class="info-text"><text class="info-label">📖 游戏说明</text><text class="info-desc">🐍 使用摇杆控制蛇的移动方向\n🍎 吃到食物可以得分\n⚠️ 撞到墙壁或自身游戏结束\n\n💪 快来挑战最高分吧！</text></view></view></view><view class="footer"><text class="footer-text">Made with ❤️</text></view><view class="btn-container"><button class="close-btn" bindtap="{{r}}">🚀 开始游戏</button></view></view></view></view>